@node CMacs Secondbrain
@chapter CMacs Secondbrain: your agentic workspace as four rings

@kbd{M-x cmacs-secondbrain} draws your agentic workspace as four
concentric rings around a centre, as a live libregnum scene inside a
cmacs buffer.  @kbd{M-x cmacs-secondbrain-3d} gives the same graph with
a free camera.

It is a sibling of @ref{CMacs Roamgraph}, not a mode of it.  Either can
be built and used without the other; what they share is
@ref{CMacs Graphcore}, so layouts, animation and collapse arrive in both.

Requires @option{--with-cmacs-secondbrain} (part of the standard flag
set), which needs @option{--with-cmacs-libregnum} and
@option{--with-cmacs-glib}.

